  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JPC Training and Policy Development Workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 1-week workshop aimed at supporting the development of Justice and Peace policy at national and diocesan levels that would inform and guide in planning of peace building activities. The workshop also aims at equipping Justice and Peace Commission (JPC) staffs at national and diocesan levels with the knowledge of Catholic Social Teaching (CST) to enable better understanding of the underlying principles of the church&#x2019;s doctrine and teachings on social justice for effective planning of peace building activities.</narrative>
  </description>
